{"id":"wb-5-482","name":"上海宋庆龄故居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"上海宋庆龄故居","text":"上海宋庆龄故居位于上海市徐汇区淮海中路1843号，是中华人民共和国名誉主席宋庆龄于1948年以后在上海的住所。该住所最早由一名希腊船主于二十世纪二十年代修建，后来为朱博泉所购，抗日战争结束后被南京国民政府收归国有，并于1948年拨给宋庆龄居住。该房屋为砖木混凝土结构，外形为船型假三层。2001年，上海宋庆龄故居被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E5%AE%8B%E5%BA%86%E9%BE%84%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85","revisionId":92089651,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92089651","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/44d046289ae5dda77cce362c.jpg","title":"Former_Residence_of_Soong_Ching-ling.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Former_Residence_of_Soong_Ching-ling.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/07/Former_Residence_of_Soong_Ching-ling.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"未知Unknown author","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​1949年春，宋庆龄迁居上海林森中路1803号（今淮海中路1843号上海宋庆龄故居）。","width":320,"height":229}}